Must be one of those packages that got autoremoved from the archive
when the debian-ports archive code was out of date with the
official debian archive.  That's all fixed now but it would appear
that there remain some source packages for which we have lost the
built binary packages.

I have scheduled a binNMU for kscreen.  It could be a couple of days
or so before it is built, installed, and shunted out to the mirrors.

Cheers
Michael.



